                      "schemaVersion": 2.1,
                      "markdown": "<div class=\"h2-bg\"><h2 class=\"text-center\" style=\"color:white\">Language</h2></div>\n<div class=\"txt-bg\" style=\"color:white\">\n<ul>\n <li>English remains the most common language spoken at home, followed by Punjabi, Urdu, Spanish, and Portuguese.</li>\n<li>91.79% of the population speak a single language at home and of these, 18.18% are a non-official language.</li>\n<li>8.21% of the population speak multiple languages at home. Of these, 95.94% include English and a non-official language, 2.19% include English and French, 1.14% include English, French and a non-official language, and 0.73% include French and a non-official language.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The chart below shows the top five languages spoken at home for the Madoc neighbourhood.</p>\n</div>\n"
