                      "markdown": "<div class=\"h2-bg\"><h2 class=\"text-center\">Method of Travel</h2></div>\n<div class=\"txt-bg\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"margin-top:0\">The use of a car as a driver is the most popular mode of transportation to work representing 70.26% of the working population in Madoc.</li>\n<li>At 16.43%, public transit is the second most popular method of transportation, followed by the use of a car as a passenger (8.27%), walking (2.79%), other modes of transportation (1.44%). and cycling (0.8%).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n"
